}], "title": "Sharpening on/off", "properties": {"ue_properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "input_ue_unconnectable": {}}, "cnr_id": "comfy-core", "ver": "0.37.0", "Node name for S&R": "ComfySwitchNode"}, "widgets_values": [false], "widgets_values_named": {"switch": false}}, {"id": 527, "type": "MarkdownNote", "pos": [80, -370], "size": [640, 460], "flags": {}, "order": 0, "mode": 0, "properties": {}, "widgets_values": ["## PlagueKind Long Video - Upscale\nUpscales a finished long-video project part by part with the V11 H3 upscaler (latent upscaler + 3 re-sample steps), then FILM 48 fps and RCAS sharpening.\n\n1. Set **Project name** (same as in PlagueKind Long Video).\n2. Set **Part number** to 1 and queue; then 2, 3, ... (or set the part widget to *increment* and queue with batch count = number of parts).\n3. Always upscale parts **in order**: a part that continues the previous one is crossfaded over their shared 1.6 s into the already upscaled previous part.\n\nResult: `output/long_video/<project>/<project>_full_upscaled.mp4` (original audio), rebuilt after every part. Parts live in `<project>/upscaled/`.\n\n- **Upscale factor** 1.5 \u2192 1280\u00d7720 parts become 1920\u00d71056 (the non-/32 padding strip is cropped).\n- **Frame interpolation** / **FSR sharpening** switches: on = 48 fps / RCAS 0.3.\n- ~12 min per 10 s part on the 3090.\n- Needs the part's saved conditioning (saved automatically by the main workflow)."]}], "links": [[49, 1, 0, 6, 0, "MODEL"], [50, 6, 0, 7, 0, "MODEL"], [51, 7, 0, 10, 0, "MODEL"], [52, 504, 1, 305, 1, "INT"], [53, 505, 1, 305, 2, "INT"], [54, 10, 0, 307, 0, "MODEL"], [55, 503, 0, 307, 1, "CONDITIONING"], [56, 502, 0, 307, 2, "LATENT"], [57, 301, 0, 307, 3, "NOISE"], [58, 302, 0, 307, 4, "SAMPLER"], [59, 303, 0, 307, 5, "SIGMAS"], [60, 305, 0, 307, 7, "H3_UPSCALE_PARAM"], [61, 304, 0, 307, 8, "H3_TEMPORAL_PARAM"], [62, 306, 0, 307, 9, "H3_SPATIAL_PARAM"], [63, 307, 0, 308, 0, "LATENT"], [64, 3, 0, 308, 1, "VAE"], [65, 500, 0, 